<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to January 15 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  2,878.8  6,700.0   Dec-Nov	4,762.2  5,371.1</p>
<p> Maize	  6,889.4  2,500.0   Mar-Feb	6,690.1  1,000.5</p>
<p> Sorghum	  665.7    670.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     24.0</p>
<p> Soybeans     2,011.8  2,050.0   Apr-Mar	2,036.0    780.5</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 537.3    600.0   Jan-Dec	  593.4     18.0</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0650</p>
</text>
